 success←GitHub_SSH_OK;cmd;r
⍝ 1 if SSH auth to GitHub works right now, else 0
⍝ Does not get stuck on "Enter passphrase" but would return a 0.
 cmd←'ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=5 '
 cmd,←'-o StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new -T git@github.com 2>&1'
 success←0
 :Trap 0
     r←⎕SH cmd
     success←∨/∨/¨('successfully authenticated'∘⍷)¨r
 :EndTrap
